{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1466762-thoughts-on-a-light-hearted-game","id":1466762,"title":"Thoughts on a Light Hearted Game?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-11-05T05:14:49-07:00","id":1466762,"title":"Thoughts on a Light Hearted Game?","content":"I love CtL and recently got 2nd edition last month! &lt;3 but is it weird to wanna do a more urban fantasy then horror or a dark drama? More be like Lost Girl or Once 'Upon a Time in tone then say Pan's Labyrinth?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27163-crimson_fairy","name":"Crimson_Fairy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27163_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-05T15:51:30-07:00","id":1466826,"title":"","content":"First, no, it isn't. There is no problem in not wanting a given chronicle to be dark and moody. Go for it.<br /> <br /> Second, the fun police won't break your door, confiscate your books and put you to jail because you used the game &quot;in unwholesome ways&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-05T16:45:10-07:00","id":1466830,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crimson_Fairy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1466762-thoughts-on-a-light-hearted-game#post1466762\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I love CtL and recently got 2nd edition last month! &lt;3 but is it weird to wanna do a more urban fantasy then horror or a dark drama? More be like Lost Girl or Once 'Upon a Time in tone then say Pan's Labyrinth?</div> </div> </div> </div>That's perfectly fine. Whatever fits your games. That's what's important. Though if I'm honest, changeling I'd actually a good game if you want an easier time of doing a light hearted campaign anyway","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-05T17:21:54-07:00","id":1466838,"title":"","content":"Nothing wrong with light hearted games, personally I'm a bit burned out from all the &quot;dark and gritty&quot; games I had lately, with some splats like vampires and werewolves it comes with the territory but a lighter urban fantasy chronicle with mages and changeling is definetely something I would like to play.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27142-newb95","name":"Newb95","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-05T17:33:48-07:00","id":1466839,"title":"","content":"I say Changeling is especially apt for that, since half the game\u2019s premise is building (back) your life.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-06T04:28:49-07:00","id":1466925,"title":"","content":"I kinda found out about CtL after watching Lost Girl and I been inspired to mostly based my chronicles off that show (It's fairly light hearted in terms of graphic content sure the main char a succubus but imo it's one of the less graphic Syfy Channel works) and I oddly feel Changeling is just as good for politics as Vampires. Everyone tells me VtM is <b>the</b> go to for politics but does no one acknowledge half the communities in Lost are Guilds in the mmo sense?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27163,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27163-crimson_fairy","user":"Crimson_Fairy","date":". 11-06-2021, 07:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27163-crimson_fairy","name":"Crimson_Fairy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27163_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-06T07:14:32-07:00","id":1466939,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crimson_Fairy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1466762-thoughts-on-a-light-hearted-game?p=1466925#post1466925\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I kinda found out about CtL after watching Lost Girl and I been inspired to mostly based my chronicles off that show (It's fairly light hearted in terms of graphic content sure the main char a succubus but imo it's one of the less graphic Syfy Channel works) and I oddly feel Changeling is just as good for politics as Vampires. Everyone tells me VtM is <b>the</b> go to for politics but does no one acknowledge half the communities in Lost are Guilds in the mmo sense?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Despite what most people think, you can run any sort of chronicles with all the splats, I had werewolves games about pack politics, mage games where the main characters were part of a paramilitary group and were all about balls to the wall action, vampire games where the main characters were trying to reconnect with their family etc. The only thing that differentiate the splats is that some are naturally better at some things than others, werewolves are the combat splats and probably the only one that has to resort to violence as a necessity but nothing says you can't create an Elodoth character with high diplomacy and people skills, sure it won't be as good as a vampire purposefully built for the task (vampires social disciplines are simply on another level compared to werewolves gifts) but you can definitely play a game with it, likewise with vampires, they can fuck with people minds more easily than most splats but nothing stops you from making a combat monster (although its going to take A LOT of xp before said character will be able to best a werewolf). Mages and changelings are the most versatile among the splats (although you still have to remember their squish factor if you plan to run a combat game), and they can be made into any archetype and used into any type of chronicles so really, don't listen too much about what people say and just run the game that you want.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27142,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27142-newb95","user":"Newb95","date":". 11-06-2021, 10:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27142-newb95","name":"Newb95","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-06T11:37:13-07:00","id":1466964,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crimson_Fairy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1466762-thoughts-on-a-light-hearted-game?p=1466925#post1466925\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I oddly feel Changeling is just as good for politics as Vampires.</div> </div> </div> </div>They are since cWoD.<br /> <br /> Both CtD and CtL are highly political games by design.<br /> <br /> It's just that they're not that &quot;mainstream&quot; among WoD players.<br /> <br /> My current Dreaming chronicle is a completely political game, by the way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}